     A**********                            REF(FSREFP)
     A**********R PDI01                     TEXT('DIAGNOSIS CODE FILE')
     A**********  DIICD9    R               REFFLD(DIA)
     A**********  DIDSC1    R               REFFLD(DS50)
     A**********                            COLHDG('DESCRIPTION' 'ONE')
     A**********  DIDSC2    R               REFFLD(DS00)
     A**********                            COLHDG('DESCRIPTION' 'TWO')
     A**********  DISTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A**********  DIUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A**********  DIPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A**********  DITIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A**********  DIDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A**********                            COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A**********  DIIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A**********                            COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A**********  DIIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A**********                            COLHDG('INITIAL' 'ENTRY' 'DATE')
     A****BEGIN*ADD *** 12/29/92 **********************************************
     A**********  DIGRP     R               REFFLD(A30)
     A**********                            COLHDG('DIAG OR' 'OPER GROUP')
     A**********  DILOST    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            COLHDG('LOS TYPE' 'DIAG OR OPER')
     A**********  DIFL1     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIFL2     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********                            CLT087: OH BWC INVALID FLAG
     A**********                                    V = VALID ICD9 CODE
     A**********                                    I = INVALID ICD9 CD
     A**********  DIFL3     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIFL4     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIFL5     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIFL6     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIFL7     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIFL8     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIFL9     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIFL10    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIDS1     R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********    Will hold "actual" ICD9 code value with decimal position
     A**********  DIDS2     R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********                            CLT087: OH BWC GROUP VALUE
     A**********  DIDS3     R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIDS4     R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A**********                            TEXT('NOT USED AT THIS TIME')
     A**********  DIDS5     R               REFFLD(DS10)
